      {
        "name": "Behavior",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "Adding the e2e label still starts the e2e job (and e2e runs on other events when the label is present), and `test` still runs on opened, synchronize and reopened; the extra tightening so unrelated labels don't re-run e2e is sensible but goes slightly beyond what was asked."
      },
